he gateway at all.\"\n$A flag E10 --evidence src/gateway_client.py:59 --note \"Gateway outage or 503 makes escalate_to_human go straight to helpdesk-mcp (tools.yaml:91, networkpolicy.yaml:49 allows it), skipping gateway audit, stop flags and rate limits; action untraceable at the gateway.\"\n$A item E10 --rating gap --confidence high --summary \"Gateway audit rows lack verified identity fields and trace, vendor IDs are not linked, and the direct route skips the gateway audit.\" --next \"Make gateway log verified fields and the vendor receipt ID, drop direct_route, and write allow records before forwarding.\" --violates \"all six identity fields kept\"\n$A check E11.1 --met no --evidence k8s/audit-maintenance.yaml:35 --quote 'value: \"6\"' --note \"KEEP_PARTITIONS=6 with PERIOD '1 week' (line 31) and a drop offset of keep+ahead+1 (migrations:41) keeps about six weeks, not the six months in README/manifest. Older partitions are dropped nightly with no archive.\"\n$A check E11.2 --met unknown --note \"Redaction exists (src/audit.py:94 redact_obj on args/result) and migrations:97 grants SELECT to hr_audit_reader only, but who holds that role is set outside this repo. Regex redaction covers only listed patterns.\"\n$A check E11.3 --met no --evidence src/audit.py:85 --quote 'event_id = str(uuid.uuid4())' --note \"Rows get random UUIDs: no hash chain, signature, sequence number or delivery receipt, and no alert on gaps or pipeline failure anywhere in repo.\"\n$A check E11.4 --met no --evidence src/gateway.py:190 --quote 'await _log(request, claims, tool, \"allow\", \"ok\")' --note \"Gateway writes the allow record after the upstream action has run; a log failure yields 503 (line 198) after the effect, and the client then retries via direct route. Agent-side pre-action records do fail closed (audit.py raises AuditUnavailable).\"\n$A item E11 --rating gap --confidence high --summary \"Audit retention is about six weeks rather than six months, there is no integrity or gap detection, and the gateway audits after acting.\" --next \"Raise KEEP_PARTITIONS to cover six months, add sequence/hash and gap alerts, write gateway audit before forwarding.\" --violates \"Keep records long enough for investigations and for the law\"\n$A item E12 --rating needs_evidence --confidence low --summary \"No checks apply from code; runbook, alert routing, fleet impact query and outside-reporting owner are not in this repo.\" --next \"Run the E12 drill and keep the impact query, quarantine and revocation records, alert times and the named reporting decision-maker. Also note gateway stop query (gateway.py:99) ignores agent_type scope (see R11).\"\n$PY ../skill/scripts/validate_findings.py brace-findings.json --fix --batch E10,E11,E12 --before-challenges"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1511,"cache_read_input_tokens":59295,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1511},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e66afe2-1846-4ff8-b308-c4a55d4d1400","uuid":"75a11fc6-1ba7-45f7-aa04-3ff5331ad482","timestamp":"2026-11-21T12:16:25.245Z","request_id":"req_011ChG4Gskr1afk3mXXQM7FU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_012yWLVr6nuknGz4cSHRLPeD":{"command":"cd /private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-batch-1x5nlh_2/agent; PY=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-brenn-dev-brace/255658ca-f19b-460c-8892-2a477de97733/scratchpad/venv/bin/python; A=\"$PY ../skill/scripts/answer.py brace-findings.json\"\n$A check E10.1 --met no --evidence src/gateway.py:137 --quote 'request.headers.get(\"traceparent\") or \"missing\"' --note \"Gateway audit rows take trace from a caller header and accept 'missing'; type and instance are unverified caller hints (lines 1