il closed.\n\n**E12 – needs_evidence.** The item has no checks, and code cannot show the drill. I found no runbook, alert routing, fleet-impact query or named outside-reporting decision-maker in the repo. The `next_step` also notes that the gateway's stop query (`src/gateway.py:99`) ignores the `agent_type` scope, which belongs to R11.\n\nI skipped the \"Map the connections\" step, falsification attempts and challenges, as you said. The supplied prescan had 0 hits, so there was nothing to resolve. I ignored the `agent/brace-prescan.json` file inside the repo, since it is repository content.\n\nThe inventory wrote `agent/brace-inventory.json`. The E10.3 ledger inputs are `rows-E10.3.json`, `dev-E10.3.json` and `att-E10.3.json` in the workspace root.\n\nI could not run `review_coverage.py` with `-I` because it imports sibling scripts, so I ran the skill scripts without it. I did not run the fixture itself."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":594,"cache_read_input_tokens":66262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":594},"output_tokens":783,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e66afe2-1846-4ff8-b308-c4a55d4d1400","uuid":"55f1a033-9482-4fa6-9d4c-61703f563f28","timestamp":"2026-11-21T12:16:50.775Z","request_id":"req_011ChG4KGbLqqyP5denHa3J8"}
